#: ../../source/docs/modules/optitrack.rst:3 581b2dc2852b48d0ae0086cc1035efc7
msgid "Optitrack Support"
msgstr "Optitrack 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/optitrack.rst:9 1cb3d0baf9054268955c0b9feb510fb2
msgid ""
"Connects to an `Optitrack motion capture server "
"<https://optitrack.com/software/motive/>`__ and passes the vehicle position "
"and orientation messages to ArduPilot via the ``ATT_POS_MOCAP`` MAVLink "
"message."
msgstr ""
"连接到 `Optitrack 动作捕捉服务器 <https://optitrack.com/software/motive/>`__，通过 "
"``ATT_POS_MOCAP`` MAVLink 消息将飞行器位置和姿态信息传递给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/optitrack.rst:13 4b88fb9f68174993bc6fd2df44e97a4f
msgid ""
"It is assumed that the server is using the default ports of 1510 and 1511."
msgstr "假设服务器使用默认端口 1510 和 1511。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/optitrack.rst:15 f651ec76befb44dabd22068048e07589
msgid "Use ``optitrack start`` to start sending position data."
msgstr "使用 ``optitrack start`` 开始发送位置数据。"

